261: 
262: ### Handed on: where the threads end
263: 
264: This is the subject's last course; no row hands on past grade 12. The threads end in the student's own adult
265: activity: the motor and training threads in unit 19 (a cue sheet the student writes and a session a partner coaches),
266: the planning threads in units 20 and 23 (a reviewed program and an active adult week), the social threads in unit 22
267: (an organized event and a community case), and the choice threads in units 20, 21, 23 and 24 (goals, barriers,
268: emotions and the look back). A student who stops after grade 10 leaves with the unit 12 plan to stay active after
269: school. The course page names community recreation as the place these threads continue; no outside program is
270: promised.
