r feedback, revised on day 11, scored at the check | Last in grade 10 because it gathers the required years into the plan every student leaves with; it needs unit 8's plan skills and the year's activities as choices | Candidate: the plan reused, unscored, as the first page of grade 11's program | Emotions: calm steps offered, never a punishment; a student may step out for a reset with a role; PE does not treat mental health conditions; the teacher page names the school counselor. Money and access: no student's family means are asked; options listed are free or low cost. Yoga as stretching and breathing, with no spiritual practice. Sensitivity read sources: the federal physical activity guidelines' adult pages; the national mental health institute's pages on stress and activity. Cost: $0 |

