s on grade 7's training principles and challenges, and its goal and obstacle rows give the year its S4 thread | Candidate: a private plot of the student's own test, never collected | Fitness test results are the student's own: never posted, graded or compared; any student may choose a different test or a role; no BMI, weight or body measures. No tool is required and no personal data is collected by the course. Sensitivity read sources: the federal physical activity guidelines' youth chapter and the professional body's position on fitness testing (the agent finds it on SHAPE America's free pages). Safety read (fitness testing). Cost: $5 (a ruler on a box for the sit-and-reach) |
